sequenceDiagram
 participant UI as Qt/QML
 participant C as DiagnosticController
 participant T as QtElm
 participant A as Authorized adapter
 participant P as C++ protocol core
 UI->>C: Explicit connection
 C->>T: Async connect + allowlisted initialization
 T->>A: AT setup and 0100
 A-->>T: Supported PID bitmap
 T-->>C: Bounded complete prompt reply
 C->>P: Validate requested service / bitmap
 loop Only supported displayed PIDs
 C->>T: One read command with deadline
 T->>A: PID request
 A-->>T: Observed response
 T-->>C: Complete reply or explicit error
 C->>P: Strict decode
 P-->>UI: Value + unit + quality + provenance + timestamp
 end
